														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1738302">
									

<p>I like it overall, but&#8230;<br />
&#8230; I gotta ask, are the Malleus folks acting as brain-dead B-movie bad guys because a Scribe has written so in one of the cult's holy texts ? :)</p>
<p>I mean, even being religious fanatics and shit, they're supposed to be trained for wiping out skips and cults related to them&#8230; and none of them went &quot;wait a moment, those guys might have written <em>a god</em> into existence, maybe we should think the implications through&quot;. How any of them survived beyond their first &quot;encounter&quot; is beyond me.</p>

